  "description": "Experience exceptional fuss-free vaping with the Geek Vape Sonder Q Pod Kit, a sleek, stylish and highly-portable pod system designed for vapers of all experience levels. This versatile device offers a maximum output of 20W , powered by a built-in 1000mAh battery, promising extended vaping sessions without the need for frequent recharging. As discreet as pod kits get, this compact vape kit is nevertheless in a dizzying array of vibrant colours to complement your personal style. The Sonder Q Pod Kit supports effortless Auto-draw activation ; No buttons or settings are required, simply inhale on the device for rich and flavoursome vapour. The mod's 3-colour ‘breathing’ LED indicator displays your current power level, ensuring you're always informed. Built with convenience in mind, the Sonder Q Pod Kit boasts a leakproof top-refill system . Simply snap off the top cap to reveal the fill port, making refilling quick, clean and hassle-free. The 2ml Geek Vape Q pod delivers outstanding flavour and vapour production. The device incorporates a unique airflow adjustment mechanism, allowing you to customise your vape to your liking. Whether you prefer a tight Mouth-to-Lung (MTL) draw or a loose Direct-to-Lung (DTL) inhale, the Sonder Q Pod Kit has got you covered. Best used with nic salt , 50/50 and classic High-PG e-liquids. Discover premium liquid vape options to elevate your experience with this kit. Pod Details: 0.4ohm Geekvape Q Replacement pod is not compatible with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
